  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">此資源包改變了許多 Minecraft 原版動物的外觀！目前，它主要變更以下動物的外觀（雖然還有更多紋理即將推出）：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 牛</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 綿羊</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 豬</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 雞</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 豹貓</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 狼</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 貓</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 熊貓</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 蘑菇牛</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 駱駝</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 駱駝木乃伊</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 烏龜</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 馬</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a>（也支援 OptiFine）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">牛、綿羊、豬、雞、熊貓與蘑菇牛的紋理及模型設計者為 AviArt。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">豹貓、狼與貓的紋理及模型設計者為 Matt_Hopes。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要伺服器來和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_promo.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在尋找能讓朋友一起遊玩任何模組或整合包的伺服器，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong></span> 就是您的最佳選擇！他們提供性價比最高的 Minecraft 伺服器，若點擊<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong></span>並使用優惠碼「Lupin」，即可享受 25% 折扣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_summary.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">此資源包改變了社群中最受歡迎的幾種原版動物的外觀，當然現在它們看起來會更寫實且有趣！但請放心，它們仍會以符合原版風格的方式呈現，同時保留與預設紋理相似的基調。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_faq.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>在伺服器上可以使用嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然可以！運作非常完美！記得要搭配模組和好友遊玩的最佳方式就是使用 BisectHosting，透過<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此連結即可享有 25% 折扣</a></strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>此資源包可以用於整合包嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！前提是僅限於發布在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 平台上。將其上傳至任何其他平台都將侵犯我們的權益，絕對不允許。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不過，若您考慮將其加入您的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 整合包中，我們將深感感激。若需要任何微調或有任何問題，歡迎聯繫我們！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Realistic_Animals/BH_Realistic_Animals_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"151\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/599/realistic-pig.png\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/600/realistic-cows-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/601/realistic-wolves-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/603/realistic-cats-7.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/975/604/realistic-ocelots-1.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY